{"source": "S3", "quote": "the total amount of compensation for delay to be paid under this condition shall not exceed 10 % (ten percent) of the accepted Tendered Value of work"},
{"source": "S1", "quote": "a levy upto 5% of tendered value of work may be imposed by the Superintending Engineer whose decision shall be final"},
{"source": "S2", "quote": "If such building though completed is occupied illegally, then the Engineer-in-Charge shall have the option to refuse to accept the said building/buildings in that position."}
