"answer": "Under the Finance Department notification dated 22.10.2021, the successful bidder must deposit an Additional Performance Security on an Unbalanced Bid, described as \"15% Below on estimated Bid value\" [S1]. The amount must be deposited within 07 days of the issue of the Letter of Acceptance [S1]. It may be paid in cash, demand draft, banker's cheque, bank guarantee or other Government Securities [S1]. The validity of the instrument must extend one month beyond the scheduled completion period of the work [S1]. The exact Hindi quote for the validity condition begins mid-sentence in the source, and the OCR text appears slightly garbled at that point [S1].",
